{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37771","headline":"温处士能画鹭鹚以四韵换之 · 郑谷","name":"温处士能画鹭鹚以四韵换之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔年吟醉绕江蓠，爱把渔竿伴鹭鹚。\n闻说小毫能纵逸，敢凭轻素写幽奇。\n涓涓浪溅残菱蔓，戛戛风搜折苇枝。\n得向晓窗闲挂翫，雪蓑烟艇恨无遗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37771.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37771","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}